{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:366b12838babeaa1","name":"Jensaarai Defender","source":{"id":"source:reference-366b12838babeaa1","title":"Jensaarai Defender","revision":18944,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:01:05Z","sha256":"23b9543a2df1aa66eee3a1bbe78f5c20ab880637ecb5b44fca5beacb672de620","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18944","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Jensaarai%20Defender&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-366b12838babeaa1","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jensaarai"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jensaarai","referenceId":"reference:b32c8cc52f3044d3"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Jensaarai"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jensaarai","referenceId":"reference:b32c8cc52f3044d3"}," are Force-using warriors from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Susevfi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Susevfi?action=edit&redlink=1"},". Originally founded by rebel Jedi in the waning days of the Republic, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jensaarai"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jensaarai","referenceId":"reference:b32c8cc52f3044d3"}," embrace some Sith teachings while still practicing a great deal of Jedi philosophy. Though they tread close to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," in many of their practices, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jensaarai"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jensaarai","referenceId":"reference:b32c8cc52f3044d3"}," still maintain the discipline required to serve ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},". \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Jensaarai"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jensaarai","referenceId":"reference:b32c8cc52f3044d3"}," are much like Jedi in their study of martial practices, but differ in that a significant event in their training involves the creation of a custom suit of ceremonial armor tailored to the individual Jensaarai Defender. These ceremonial suits of armor resemble creatures that represent personality traits and favored philosophies of their bearers, and Jensaarai attune themselves to their armor in order to fight at maximum efficiency. Though the bulk of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jensaarai"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jensaarai","referenceId":"reference:b32c8cc52f3044d3"}," are found on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Susevfi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Susevfi?action=edit&redlink=1"},", many venture out into the galaxy to explore and learn more about other worlds before returning to their duties. \n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Jensaarai Defender Encounters"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Jensaarai Defenders are relatively secretive, and they fight only when forced to. They dedicate themselves to protecting their people, the inhabitants of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Susevfi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Susevfi?action=edit&redlink=1"},", and the other Jensaarai. When engaged in combat, they tend to fight hard and are unwilling to surrender. They focus their Force usage on defensive situations, preferring to confront enemies head-on rather than through ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},". Jensaarai Defenders usually attack voraciously, hoping to eliminate any threat to their safety and secrecy before the enemy can escape. Jensaarai have a particular disdain for Jedi, and they will seek out a Jedi on the field of combat whenever one is present, to the exclusion of all other foes. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Encounters involving a Jensaarai Defender rarely include Force-users from other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Traditions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Traditions","referenceId":"reference:da4e2621bc8ff060"}," (Jedi or otherwise). Jensaarai Defenders are formidable enemies when encountered in small groups, especially when they can get close enough to engage their enemies in melee combat. Additionally, some Jensaarai design their armors based on favored creatures, and might even have one of those creatures as a pet; for example, a Jensaarai Defender whose armor resembles a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vornskr"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vornskr","referenceId":"reference:f5bdbc4aecca503f"}," might bring her pet ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vornskrs"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vornskrs"}," into battle to fight at her side.  \n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Jensaarai Defender Statistics (CL 8)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"}," 5/",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soldier","referenceId":"reference:f826baa05bef6921"}," 3\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 4; ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},":"]}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +11; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +5\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic